# Next.js UI

## Components & styling

- Use Shadcn UI and Tailwind CSS for components and styling
- All shadcn components live at `src/components/ui/`
- Implement responsive, mobile-first design with Tailwind CSS
- **Colors:** follow `color-theming.mdc` — semantic Tailwind tokens only, no raw hex/hsl/oklch in TSX
- **Accessibility:** follow `accessibility-wcag.mdc` — WCAG 2.2 AA baseline on all UI

## Performance

- Minimize `'use client'`, `useEffect`, and `setState`; favor React Server Components
- Wrap client components in `<Suspense>` with a fallback
- Use `dynamic()` from `next/dynamic` for non-critical client components
- Optimize images via `next/image` (see `nextjs-core.mdc`)
